  "name": "levels/level-2-organization-verified",
  "description": "Level 2 (ORGANIZATION_VERIFIED): an AgentCard carrying an organization attestation signed by a trust registry (Ed25519 over the RFC 8785 JCS canonicalization of the attestation object with the signature field excluded). A conforming verifier checks that the attestation subject binds to the declared agentId and kid, verifies the registry signature against the pinned issuer public key, and confirms the pinned validationTime falls inside [verifiedAt, expiresAt]. The issuer key is RFC 8032 §7.1 Test 2 (registry role); the agent key is Test 1.",
